1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,467
Hovlingiz tartibli va
salobatli ko‘rinsinmi?

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:05,567
Bu uslubda hamma narsa

3
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:08,967
aniq tartib va muvozanat
asosida quriladi.

4
00:00:08,967 --> 00:00:11,733
Avval asosiy yo‘nalish
belgilanadi.

5
00:00:11,733 --> 00:00:14,933
Yo‘lak hovlining markaziy
o‘qiga aylanadi.

6
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:16,533
Keyin ikki tomonda

7
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,867
bir-biriga mos shakl va
takrorlanish yaratiladi.

8
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:23,500
Gulzorlar, yo‘laklar va
yashil hoshiyalar

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,267
sodda geometrik shakllarda
joylashadi.

10
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,333
Kompozitsiyaning markazida esa

11
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:31,633
ko‘zni tortadigan bitta
asosiy urg‘u bo‘ladi.

12
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:33,333
To‘g‘ri rejalashtirilsa,

13
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:36,533
klassik uslub kichik hovlida ham
chiroyli ishlaydi.

14
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:40,000
Muhimi — o‘lcham va parvarishni
hisobga olish.
